<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-RESULT OF PARIS OPEN DOUBLES FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULT OF PARIS OPEN DOUBLES FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Paris Open doubles final on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Jacco Eltingh/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat 4-Yevgeny</p>
<p>Kafelnikov (Russia)/Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-4 4-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2).</p>
</text>
